  <Callout kind="remember">
    Setters only record; <code>build()</code> validates everything once,
    throws once with every problem listed, and then constructs the engine in a
    fixed order that ends with the <code>ReelSet</code>. Your <code>.phases()</code> overrides always run last, and the reel-making code
    is a snapshot of the builder, so reusing a builder is safe.
  </Callout>
